      "question": "<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g(x) = (2 + ax)^8\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> is a constant</p><p>Given that one of the terms in the binomial expansion of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g(x)\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3402x^5\"></span></p><p>(a) find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p><p>Using this value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span>,</p><p>(b) find the constant term in the expansion of</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left(1 + \\frac{1}{x^4}\\right)(2 + ax)^8\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
